  "uncertainty": "As of 2026-10-04, the dossier establishes Nash Holdings as the ultimate corporate holding company and Jeff Bezos as its controlling owner, but does not establish the precise current legal publishing entity or the ownership links between that entity and Nash Holdings. WP Company LLC is identified only as a subsidiary of the seller in the 2013 acquisition agreement; that does not establish its current legal ownership role. Accordingly, legal_owner and operator are not_established, and no complete legal-owner chain is supplied. Graham-family ownership is historical, and Bezos’s Amazon affiliation does not establish Amazon ownership of the newspaper. D’Onofrio’s September 2026 permanent appointment supersedes the February reports describing him as acting or interim CEO."
